        "text_x33WR9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong><br/>WELCOME OFFER 15% OFF FIRST PURCHASE</strong></p><p>For a limited time, new customers who subscribe to our email list will receive a one-time-use coupon code for <strong>15% off their first purchase</strong>. Discount applies to merchandise total <strong>before taxes and shipping</strong> and <strong>after any other discounts</strong>.</p><p>Offer is valid for <strong>new subscribers only</strong>. Customers who have previously subscribed or registered at milanojewelry.com are not eligible. Coupon code will be sent via email and must be applied at checkout at time of purchase.</p><p>Excludes sale items, warranty and repair services, upgraded shipping options, and prior purchases. Cannot be combined with other promotions or promotional codes. Code is non-transferable and valid for one-time use only.</p><p>Purchases are subject to our standard return policy. Milano Jewelry reserves the right to modify or discontinue this offer at any time. Void where prohibited.<br/><br/><strong>20% OFF GEMSTONE JEWELRY</strong><br/>Enjoy 20% off all gemstone jewelry from October 1 through October 18, 2026, at 11:59 PM ET. Discount automatically applies at checkout. Offer valid on eligible gemstone jewelry only. Excludes gift cards, custom jewelry, warranty and repair services, taxes, and shipping fees. Cannot be combined with other promotions, discount codes, or offers. Previous purchases are excluded. Milano Jewelry reserves the right to modify or end the promotion at any time.<br/><strong><br/></strong><br/><strong><br/>MILANO x SAVE THE WHALES PARTNERSHIP</strong></p><p>Milano Jewelry is proud to partner with <a href=\"https://savethewhales.org/\" title=\"https://savethewhales.org/\"><strong>SavetheWhales.org</strong></a>, a respected nonprofit organization dedicated to protecting the ocean and its magnificent inhabitants through education and long-term conservation efforts — ensuring future generations inherit not just memories of the sea, but thriving ecosystems beneath the waves.<br/><br/><strong>Contribution Details</strong></p><ul><li>5% of proceeds from eligible purchases within the <em>Whale Collection</em> will be contributed to Savethewhales.org in support of their conservation initiatives.</li><li>Contribution applies only to products specifically marked under the Whale Collection.</li><li>Discounts, promotional codes, or gift card purchases are not applicable to these products.</li><li>Donations are calculated based on net sales, excluding taxes, shipping charges, and returns.</li><li>Returns or cancellations will proportionately adjust the final donation amount.</li></ul><p><strong>Terms</strong></p><p>This is an ongoing partnership effective from 15th February 2026. Milano Jewelry reserves the right to modify, suspend, or conclude this initiative at its discretion.</p>",
